	abstract = {The Creative Question Challenge (CQC) brings together two speakers from different disciplines and backgrounds and a facilitator -- called Catalyst -- to create questions for the world to ponder within a 30-minute time limit. The CQC's online platform not only provides a live experience of CQC's taking place around the world, but also provides access to previous CQC's that have taken place. In addition, reactions to those CQCs, or actions on the questions generated, are also visualized and encourage new participation. The viewers were also welcomed to join us by posting their comments or questions in the YouTube live chat. Selected ideas and questions were included in the discussion and map. In this session of CQC, our initial question was: What is the Future of Art in Education? Selection Channel Saturday 12th September 2020 https://ars.electronica.art/keplersga...   ~~/~arselectronica~~   ~~/~arselectronica~~   ~~/~arselectronica~~   https://www.flickr.com/photos/arselec...},
